# Instagram Graph API credentials
# 1. Create a Facebook App at developers.facebook.com and add the Instagram Graph API product.
# 2. Connect an Instagram Business or Creator account to a Facebook Page.
# 3. Generate a long-lived User Access Token (valid ~60 days; refresh before it expires).
#    You can use the Graph API Explorer at developers.facebook.com/tools/explorer/
#    or exchange a short-lived token: GET /oauth/access_token?grant_type=fb_exchange_token&...
# 4. Find your Instagram User ID: GET /me?fields=id&access_token=<token>

VITE_IG_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_long_lived_user_access_token_here
VITE_IG_USER_ID=your_instagram_user_id_here
